  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>40</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>39</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>37</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>39</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>39</mn></msub></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>39</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>19</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>37</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
